  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to defense of rights of refugees and to good governance in the Fizi territory</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is to support local actors in the prevention and the management of conflicts that can hamper  the decentralization process in the territories of Uvira , of Fizi  and of Mwenga. It will therefore strengthen the capacity of social leaders and opinion makers (youth, women, religious leaders, civil society actors, local traditional leaders, leaders of CLGP, returnees, displaced, ...)  to prevent conflicts that could arise  in the overall decentralization process.</narrative>
  </description>
